{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"游走的单子"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"游走的单子"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>游走的单子是 $2$-范畴 $\\mathbf{B}\\Delta_+$. 其有一个对象 $*$, 且 $\\operatorname{Hom}(*,*)\\simeq\\Delta_+$.</p>\n<p>游走的单子 $\\mathbf{B}\\Delta_+$ 也是"},{"Local":{"url":"游走的伴随","text":"游走的伴随"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Adj}$ 的一个全子范畴.</p>\n"}]}}